---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Aleksandr Zhdanov | Robotics, Computer Vision & MLOps Engineer">
  <section class="mb-14">
    <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-800/60 rounded-full">
      M.Sc. Computer Vision & Robotics (TU Munich) · 11+ Years Engineering
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100 mb-4">
      Deterministic Systems for Computer Vision, Robotics & Production ML
    </h1>
    <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
      I design fault-tolerant ML execution pipelines, real-time vision-to-action ROS 2 pipelines, and automated quality gates that keep models reliable under distribution shift, hardware constraints, and production load.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-14">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100">Selected Architecture & Engineering Case Studies</h2>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">5 Featured Systems</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Case 1: MCP Robot Welding & CUDA -->
      <a
        href="/mlops-portfolio/cases/mcp-robot-welding"
        class="group block p-6 bg-slate-900/70 border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-400 transition"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">ROBOTICS · MCP SDK v2 · CUDA</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">Read case →</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          MCP Robot Welding Simulator & CUDA Spatial Indexing
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Deterministic safety gates, 6-DoF inverse kinematics (SE(3)/SO(3)), MELFA-BASIC postprocessor, and 185.2x GPU-accelerated Morton code collision broadphase on NVIDIA T4.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">MCP v2</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">6-DoF IK</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">CUDA / C++</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Case 2: ML Workload Execution Platform -->
      <a
        href="/mlops-portfolio/cases/execution-platform"
        class="group block p-6 bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">MLOPS · DISTRIBUTED SYSTEMS</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">Read case →</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          Fault-Tolerant ML Workload Execution Platform
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Asynchronous GPU inference orchestration with FastAPI, RabbitMQ, Redis, PostgreSQL, strict VRAM admission control, and 4-tier release quality gates.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">FastAPI</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">RabbitMQ</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">Docker / CI</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Case 3: ASL Gesture Recognition & Quality Gates -->
      <a
        href="/mlops-portfolio/cases/asl-recognition"
        class="group block p-6 bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">COMPUTER VISION · BENCHMARKING</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">Read case →</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          Cross-Domain Gesture Detection & Automated Quality Gates
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          End-to-end YOLO11n training and evaluation pipeline with held-out Hugging Face benchmarks, synthetic domain-shift stress matrices, and CI regression gates.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">YOLO11n</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">PyTorch</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">Pytest CI</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Case 4: Gesture Swarm ROS 2 -->
      <a
        href="/mlops-portfolio/cases/gesture-swarm-ros2"
        class="group block p-6 bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">ROS 2 · MULTI-AGENT CONTROL</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">Read case →</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          Vision-Driven Multi-Agent Swarm Control in ROS 2
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Decoupled perception and cmd_vel actuation nodes with RANSAC-style temporal consensus filtering, safety watchdogs, and collision-avoidance coordination.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">ROS 2</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">OpenCV</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">RANSAC</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Case 5: Incident Lab -->
      <a
        href="/mlops-portfolio/cases/incident-lab"
        class="group block p-6 bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition md:col-span-2"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">RELIABILITY · OBSERVABILITY · KUBERNETES</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">Read case →</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          Production Incident Lab & Latency Degradation Diagnostics
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Reproducible failure injection lab diagnosing Linux CFS CPU throttling, connection pool exhaustion, and p99 tail-latency spikes using Prometheus, Grafana, and Locust.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">Kubernetes</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">Prometheus</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-800 rounded">Locust</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
